# Naming

Источник правды: `docs/NAMING.md`.

## Language in code

- Identifiers (types, functions, files, folders, API `error.code`) — **English**
- Comments and JSDoc — **Russian**
- Vitest `describe` / `it` / `test` titles — **Russian**
- **UI copy** in admin / web / mobile (labels, buttons, errors, empty states) — **Russian only** for now (no English UI “for later”; i18n is a separate decision)
- OK in English: third-party API quotes, product/brand names, ticket refs in TODO

## Identifiers

- `camelCase` — variables, functions, methods, hooks
- `PascalCase` — React components, Nest classes, types, interfaces, enums
- `UPPER_SNAKE` — true constants (`APP_BRAND`)
- Never kebab/snake in identifier names

## Files & folders

- Folders / slices / units: `kebab-case` (`home-page/`, `orders-service/`)
- Utils, models, hooks, dto, non-component specs: `kebab-case`
- **React component files: `PascalCase`** matching export (`HomePage.tsx`, `HomePage.spec.tsx`)
- Nest: `name.role.ts` (`orders.controller.ts`, `auth.service.ts`)
- Unit/slice public API: `index.ts`

Do not rename Next/Expo reserved route files (`page.tsx`, `_layout.tsx`, …).
